---
source: crates/rune-cli/tests/limits.rs
description: a config allocating without end
expression: "redact(test.dir(), &stderr_of(&output))"
---
rune.config.ts asked for more memory than a config may use while it is evaluated: the limit is 32 MB

rune stops here itself so that the operating system does not stop it instead, which ends the process with nothing on screen.

set RUNE_CONFIG_MEMORY_LIMIT_MB higher for a config that genuinely needs more.
